{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47156","headline":"怀齐己 · 昙域","name":"怀齐己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬓髯秋景两苍苍，静对茅斋一炷香。\n病後身心俱澹泊，老来朋友半凋伤。\n峨眉山色侵云直，巫峡滩声入夜长。\n犹喜深交有支遁，时时音信到松房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昙域","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}